<aside class="affiliate-box" id="labor-and-storage">
  <p class="eyebrow">Advertisement · Affiliate disclosure</p>
  <h2>Need a crew, or a place to put things mid-move?</h2>
  <p>If you already have a truck or a portable container, <strong>HireAHelper</strong> is a public marketplace for booking labor-only loading and unloading. If you also need a unit during the move, <strong>Neighbor</strong> is a storage marketplace. Until those programs issue a tracked link, the buttons below go to each company’s public website.</p>
  <p class="disclosure">{{ site.disclosure }}</p>
  <ul class="affiliate-links">
    {% for key, program in site.affiliates %}
    <li>
      <a class="button" href="{{ program | affiliateHref }}" {% if program | affiliateIsTracked %}rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"{% else %}rel="noopener"{% endif %} target="_blank">{{ program.name }}</a>
      {% if not (program | affiliateIsTracked) %}
      <span class="muted small">Public website — not a tracked affiliate link yet.</span>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</aside>
